 "Record your screen with audio in Chrome: tab sound, system audio and mic | Vynko": "",
 "Free Chrome and Edge screen recorder with tab sound, system audio and microphone. Live sound level, pause and resume, export MP4, WebM or GIF.": "",
 "Record your screen with audio in Chrome: tab sound, system audio and mic": "",
 "Click the Vynko icon and open Record.": "",
 "Turn on Microphone to add your voice, and System sound for other apps. A level bar moves as sound comes in.": "",
 "Choose Tab to record this tab with its sound, or Window or screen, pick Entire screen and tick \"Share system audio\" in the sharing box.": "",
 "Press Stop. The video opens in its own tab, ready to trim and download as MP4 or WebM.": "",
 "Can Vynko record system audio?": "",
 "Yes. Turn on System sound, choose Window or screen, pick Entire screen and tick Share system audio. It works on Windows, ChromeOS and Mac (macOS 14.2 or newer with a recent Chrome).": "",
 "Will my voice and the tab sound be mixed?": "",
 "Yes, both go into one soundtrack.": "",
 "Is there a time limit?": "",
 "No. You can set an optional auto-stop if you want one.": "",
 "Record a tab with its own sound, or your whole screen with sound from other apps like a WhatsApp call, and add your voice from the microphone, with live level bars so you can see sound is coming through.": "",
